  "subject": "A Tamsui kite maker whose Saturday customer keeps coming back to buy the same red-tailed butterfly kite, always 'lost' with the string cut clean as if by scissors, until she hides her phone number on the tail and he comes in empty-handed to invite her to the riverbank.",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien Zimbabwean-style mbira pop, bouncy interlocking groove. Mbira playing a looping two-bar ostinato with bright metallic buzz; hosho shakers keeping steady eighth notes; clean electric guitar interlocking with the mbira in offset patterns; electric bass walking a rolling line; drum kit with a light closed hi-hat and rim click. Dry live band mix, bright interlocking parts, plain close vocal. Female alto, bright and slightly cheeky, clearly sung melody, one lead voice. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 112 BPM, G major. Playful, teasing Saturday mood. No rap, no trap hi-hats, no autotune, no synth pads, no EDM drop, no throat singing.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n我佇淡水開一間風吹店\n竹仔剖幼 紙仔糊平\n逐禮拜六 有一个少年\n買一隻風吹 紅尾的蝶仔\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n伊講欲去河邊放\n暗頭仔 提空手轉來\n\n[Chorus]\n線斷去矣 伊講線斷去矣\n斷甲遮整齊 親像剪刀剪\n線斷去矣 我共伊收錢\n閣做一隻 等伊禮拜六\n\n[Verse]\n我問伊 風敢真大\n伊講 大 線予風拖走\n我看伊的手 無半條線痕\n乖乖仔 共錢數予我\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n第五擺 我偷偷佇尾溜\n寫一組電話號碼\n\n[Chorus]\n線斷去矣 這擺我知影\n斷甲遮整齊 是伊家己剪\n線斷去矣 我嘛袂受氣\n閣做一隻 等伊禮拜六\n\n[Verse]\n這禮拜六 伊空手入來\n講今仔日 毋是欲買風吹\n袂放矣 免剪線矣\n伊講欲請我 做伙去河邊\n\n[Bridge]\n一條線 兩个人 牽\n風來風去 攏無要緊\n\n[Chorus]\n線無斷 這擺線無斷\n兩个人牽 一隻紅蝶仔\n線無斷 我嘛袂收錢\n這隻 算我送你\n\n[Outro]\n紅尾的蝶仔 佇河邊\n兩條手 牽一條線",
